title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\">Faerie Fire</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Bolt_(Condition)\" title=\"Guiding Bolt (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guiding Bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Bolt_(Condition)\" title=\"Guiding Bolt (Condition)\">Guiding Bolt</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-128&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-193</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/38px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/50px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Araj Oblodra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a> on the main floor</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-92&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-78</span>: Sold by Araj Oblodra in <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Draughts\" title=\"Crimson Draughts\">Crimson Draughts</a> if not acquired from her in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Hunter's Eye:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Though not stated in the description, Hunter's Eye also functions with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/20px-Hex_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/30px-Hex_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/40px-Hex_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hex\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/20px-Hex_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\">Hex</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Hunter's Eye:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Hunter's Eye requires the wearer to be the <i>source</i> of the mentioned conditions on the target; it does not provide an attack roll bonus if another character is the source of the conditions.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</